<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine pension funds yield 19.84 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Argentine pension funds yield 19.84 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's private pension funds achieved an average return of 19.84 percent in 1996, the pensions Superintendency said Thursday.</p>
<p>The maximum return attained was 25.79 percent, while the lowest return was 13.89 percent, the Superintendency said.</p>
<p>The annualized return since the private pension funds were first established in mid-1994 was 17.57 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Walter Bianchi, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0633))</p>
